     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"DE-CH\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear all,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Here are two vacancies (one post-doc and one PhD) that may be of interest to you. The successful candidates will be based at the Vogelwarte Sempach and will be supervised by myself and Marc Kéry.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">For more details about the Post-Doc position see here:\r\n<a href=\"https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5612&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493143389000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Wd-jQb1MCmZ0Sbqe0Tkq9\">https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5612</a>\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">For more details about the PhD position see here:\r\n<a href=\"https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5492\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5492&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493143389000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37ePwS47tNPM8GB4hhRj9T\">https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5492</a>\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Attached are also pdfs with descriptions of both.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you for spreading!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Kind regards<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Michael<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span>Michael Schaub<br>\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">Leiter Bereich &quot;Populationsbiologie&quot;</span><br>\r\nDozent an der Universität Bern<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Tel. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><a href=\"tel:+41%2041%20462%2097%2066\" value=\"+41414629766\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">++41 41 462 97 66</a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:blue\">Michael...@vogelwarte.ch</span></a></span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;color:blue\"><br>\r\n</span></u><span><a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493143389000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04lBZ_aPD5lYV0PTfJPqhJ\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;color:blue\">www.vogelwarte.ch</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Check out our brand-new book about ‘Integrated Population Models’ at\r\n</span><span><a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch/ipm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch/ipm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493143389000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10rln1gFjm2cW7DzLcjgtl\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:blue\">www.vogelwarte.ch/ipm</span></a></span><